#D7D7AF][/dim]that used it, publishes as a numbered Markdown reference link, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]writes a `Referenced By` table back into the cited artifact, and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]gets a generated \"Artifacts\" sub-tab in ACE.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]9[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]artifact_ref_contract.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/artifact_ref_contract.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-js[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-js/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Ref contract wire types in sase-core[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: define the versioned provider/entry/resolution/use wire types, the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]closed expansion formatter, quoted-argument grammar, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`@stitch`/`@patch`/path-`@file` kinds with permanent legacy aliases, the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shared numeric Markdown-link allocator, and the `Referenced By` footer [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]block; release the binding.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Retire the ref xprompt surface[/bold #D7AFFF]                                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]retire[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]retire: delete the `#ref/<kind>` xprompt adapter, its packaged renderer [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bodies, the synthetic source schemes, the precedence table, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]catalog, completion, LSP, and docs surfaces built on it, falling [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]builtins back to hardcoded rendering.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Provider registry, plugin hooks, and config[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]registry[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core, retire[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]registry: add the `sase_artifact` pluggy project with ref-provider and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]file-hook provider hookspecs, the spec registry with `use:`/inline merge[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and validation, the config schema deltas, the builtin `plan` provider, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the `sase init` writer, and fail-soft diagnostics.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Builtin refs and prompt ref context[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]builtins[dim] · [dim][/dim]after registry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]builtins: thread an explicit per-segment `PromptRefContext` through late[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prompt processing, implement `@stitch`, `@patch`, `@bead`, and `@agent` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolution on it, record one immutable use row per ref occurrence, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]land the legacy parse aliases.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The @file ref and the content-addressed store[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]files[dim] · [dim][/dim]after registry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]files: add the `artifact_refs.file.roots` allow-list, launch-time [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture with a single byte read and full SHA-256, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]one-object-per-digest store in the agents sidecar, and durable [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]logical-path/version indexing at publication.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Reference links and Referenced By write-back[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]linking[dim] · [dim][/dim]after builtins, files[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]linking: rewrite published prompts to numbered `\\[@kind:arg][N]` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reference links with revision-pinned destinations, and reconcile a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]managed `Referenced By` table plus structured index into each cited [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]artifact repo through the publication outbox.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Generated Artifacts sub-tabs and the new Files pane[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]ace[dim] · [dim][/dim]after builtins, files[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ace: make the Artifacts sub-tab set dynamic, collapse the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plans/chats/files panes into one provider-driven documents pane, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rebuild Files as one row per logical file with version toggling and a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]visible origin badge.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The sase-research plugin repository[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]research[dim] · [dim][/dim]after registry[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]research: build `sase-org/sase-research` as an installable plugin owning[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the `research` ref provider, the `research-highlights` file-hook [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]provider, and the `#research*` xprompts, with wheel-level CI, tests, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]documentation.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  9 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Adoption, glossary, and documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]adopt[dim] · [dim][/dim]after linking, ace, research[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]adopt: link and install the research plugin, move Bryan's config to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`use:` plus overrides, add the `@file` roots for `~/bob`, add the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Artifact Reference glossary term, and rewrite the affected documentation[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]end to end.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-js","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-js.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-js.1"},"source_run_id":"run-a1adc70930dc1ff531ff8ab30f622454","started_at":"2026-08-11T17:27:31.795116+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"bf8e75587a5d199fc55908474c5c3c25f6067645a477cae3f8c9f304dfea6e8f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-js.7/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"55cc1583bf64ab2dff4517893857aea9c0e30ac0b0e5a788220ec6e4347ba807","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-js.7/meta.json","size_bytes":631},"prompt":{"digest":"667b9caf6bf04e7fe0cec25d2147a94bcb2c43cb48cceb2af067d184f3b844a7","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-js.7/prompt.md","size_bytes":182},"state":{"digest":"7e13a4925284f29bdccf2b14f0f410623b4e739275047a5bb859c67cc734d1d5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-js.7/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-js.7","local_name":"sase-js.7","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-js","agent_clan_generation":"20260811132710","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-js.7","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-js","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-js.7","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-d7932a7b2a2566240d5526c3ba2d56cc","started_at":"20260811132717","state":"waiting"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"befbefed957fc